- "Fenrith Fenrir: The mercilessly cold breath of the Northern winds,"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#662 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Come like the silent dawn mist and freeze everything!!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#663 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Appear!!! Frost Misty!!!!!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#667 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Heaven's sword piercing the sky"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#668 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: I wish to borrow your strength for a moment!!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#669 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Let fall here your extreme strength that can tear even the vacuum!!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#682 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Sword that can control life and death, and pierce space time!!!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#683 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Come out Baretis Spear!!!!!!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#686 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Now! I put Sarah in critical condition! You have to finish her off! Attack her quickly! Sarah is strong!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#688 (npctalk)
- "Sarah Irene: Hurk...this.. cannot happen!!! I cannot lose!!!!!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#689 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Since you may not be able to finish her off alone, I will prepare one final spell!!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#691 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Heaven's sword piercing the sky"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#692 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: I wish to borrow your strength for a moment!!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#693 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Let fall here your extreme strength that can tear even the vacuum!!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#694 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Sword that can control life and death, and pierce space time!!!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#695 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Come out Baretis Spear!!!!!!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#708 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Sentinel Breeze! I have it in my hand!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#709 (npctalk)
- "Sarah Irene: Hurk...."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#710 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: I can find Baldur with this!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#711 (npctalk)
- "Sarah Irene: Not yet!!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#713 (npctalk)
- "Sarah Irene: Hehe... You evade well like a rat."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#714 (npctalk)
- "Sarah Irene: However, I cannot let you leave with that."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#715 (npctalk)
- "Sarah Irene: I will blow this entire castle away! Yaah!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#717 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: She is planning to collapse this place! I must perform a large scale teleportation!!!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#719 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Farewell Valkyrie!! I shall take the Sentinel Breeze! So long!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#727 (cutin)
- "fenrir_b.bmp"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#728 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Hehe.. You are certainly skilled but I think you have underestimated me, Valkyrie."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#732 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: If we don't escape now we will suffer a gruesome fate by Sarah's monsters and magic!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#733 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: Let's meet at Glast Heim entrance where we first met! If we flee that far it should be safe!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#734 (npctalk)
- "Fenrith Fenrir: There is no time! Hurry!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/SarahAndFenrir.txt#848 (cutin)
